{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = x^2\n  ucas: range it\nrange of it -> u8:\n  0..249   (44 distinct values)\n  values: 0..1, 4, 9, 16..17, 25, 33, 36, 41, 49, 57, 64..65, 68, 73, 81, 89, 97, 100, 105, 113, 121, 129, 132, 137, 144..145, ...\n  fits in u8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "what is the range of x squared for x an unsigned byte", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: u8) = x^2", "range it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "range", "type": "u8", "empty": false, "exhaustive": true, "points": 256, "undefined_points": 0, "min": {"value": 0, "exact": "0"}, "max": {"value": 249, "exact": "249"}, "distinct": 44, "values": [0, 1, 4, 9, 16, 17, 25, 33, 36, 41, 49, 57, 64, 65, 68, 73, 81, 89, 97, 100, 105, 113, 121, 129, 132, 137, 144, 145, 153, 161, 164, 169, 177, 185, 193, 196, 201, 209, 217, 225, 228, 233, 241, 249], "fits": "u8"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "every point of the domain evaluated"}, "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = x^2\n  ucas: range it\nrange of it -> u8:\n  0..249   (44 distinct values)\n  values: 0..1, 4, 9, 16..17, 25, 33, 36, 41, 49, 57, 64..65, 68, 73, 81, 89, 97, 100, 105, 113, 121, 129, 132, 137, 144..145, ...\n  fits in u8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = x*x\n  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2\n  ucas: equiv it that\nit and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "is x times x the same as x squared for an unsigned byte x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: u8) = x*x", "that(x: u8) = x^2", "equiv it that"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "equiv", "equal": true, "exhaustive": true, "mismatch_points": 0, "method": "exhaustive"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "every point of the domain"}, "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = x*x\n  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2\n  ucas: equiv it that\nit and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = x*2\n  ucas: wrap it\nwrap analysis of it:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "does x times 2 overflow for a signed byte x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: i8) = x*2", "wrap it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "wrap", "exhaustive": true, "operations": [{"op": "2x", "type": "i8", "nuw": false, "unsigned_wrap_points": 128, "unsigned_wrap_example": "x=-128", "nsw": false, "signed_wrap_points": 128, "signed_wrap_example": "x=-128", "c_ub": true}], "end_to_end": {"exact": false, "mismatch_points": 128, "mismatch_example": "x=-128", "exact_for": [[-64, 63]]}}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = x*2\n  ucas: wrap it\nwrap analysis of it:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: 1..255\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "where is 1/x defined for x an unsigned byte", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: u8) = 1/x", "domain it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "x != 0  (in 1/x)"}], "defined_points": 255, "points": 256, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 1, "undefined_example": "x=0", "c_ub_example": "x=0"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: 1..255\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: diff it x\nd/dx it = 2x\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "what is the derivative of x squared with respect to x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^2", "diff it x"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "diff", "vars": ["x"], "order": 1, "derivative": "2x"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 201, "max_diff": 1.7545867674548653e-15, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: diff it x\nd/dx it = 2x\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)\n"}, "isError": false}}
