{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = x*2\n  ucas: wrap it\nwrap analysis of it:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "please does x times 2 overflow for a signed byte x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: i8) = x*2", "wrap it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "wrap", "exhaustive": true, "operations": [{"op": "2x", "type": "i8", "nuw": false, "unsigned_wrap_points": 128, "unsigned_wrap_example": "x=-128", "nsw": false, "signed_wrap_points": 128, "signed_wrap_example": "x=-128", "c_ub": true}], "end_to_end": {"exact": false, "mismatch_points": 128, "mismatch_example": "x=-128", "exact_for": [[-64, 63]]}}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = x*2\n  ucas: wrap it\nwrap analysis of it:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
